<title>USA: Carolina Power, PECO in power deal.</title>
<headline>Carolina Power, PECO in power deal.</headline>
<dateline>RALEIGH, N.C. 1997-07-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Carolina Power &amp; Light said it has agreed with PECO Energy Co to to purchase up to 300 megawatts of peaking power from PECO for the summer periods of 1999 to 2003.</p>
<p>Terms of the deal, which is part of a series of competitive tenders for power issued by CP&amp;L, were not disclosed.</p>
<p>CP&amp;L said it is also is looking to the marketplace for additional 1999 resources.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsroom 212 859 1902))</p>
